memoria-editor-core
===================

Original implementation for KOS-149. No code was copied from third-party
live-preview markdown editors.

Design informed (behavioral reference only, no code reuse) by:

- Obsidian's Live Preview hide-marker rule (markers visible under cursor)
- SuperMD / Typora live-preview conventions
- ProseMirror history grouping semantics (newGroupDelay)
- Memoria (Vue/Tiptap) command + serialization behavior — the parity target

Third-party crates: ropey (MIT), unicode-segmentation (MIT/Apache-2.0),
pulldown-cmark (MIT), proptest / criterion / libfuzzer-sys (dev only).
